      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-02-10T17:49:07Z",
      "side": 0,
      "message": "Yep, I\u0027m suggesting to move the whole \u003cnvhe/spinlock.h\u003e file into a kernel-visible location (\u003casm/hyp_spinlock.h\u003e or something). hyp_spinlock_t _is_ part of the KMI, it\u0027s used by the kernel and modules, etc, so it\u0027d be a shame if the ABI tooling lost visibility into it.",
      "parentUuid": "f4486cd9_c23315ad",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 62,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 62,
        "endChar": 23
      },
      "revId": "fc99bcd94b4d2b414a05926a8f1c3536cd0516bd",
